  <item>
    <title>Global Health Spending 1995-2022, 14 November 2025</title>
    <link>https://ghdx.healthdata.org/record/ihme-data/global-health-spending-1995-2022-20251114</link>
    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-time field-type-datetime field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;January, 1995 - December, 2022&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;	&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-type field-type-taxonomy-term-reference field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
				&lt;div class=&quot;field-items clearfix&quot;&gt;
							&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/data-type/estimate&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot; datatype=&quot;&quot;&gt;Estimate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
					&lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-provider field-type-taxonomy-term-reference field-label-inline clearfix&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;Provider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/organizations/institute-health-metrics-and-evaluation-ihme&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot; datatype=&quot;&quot;&gt;Institute for Health Metrics and Evaluation (IHME)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-summary field-type-text field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Research by the Global Burden of Disease Health Financing Collaborator Network produced estimates for 1995-2022 for 204 countries and territories covering total health spending, spending disaggregated by source into three domestic financing categories (government, out-of-pocket, and prepaid private), and development assistance for health (DAH). Source data came from the WHO’s Global Health Expenditure Database (GHED), program reports, budget data, national estimates, and National Health Accounts (NHAs). These estimates were used to forecast GDP and prospective health spending estimates for 2023-2050. Estimates are reported in constant 2023 United States Dollars, constant 2023 purchasing power parity adjusted (PPP) dollars, and as a percent of gross domestic product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Though not released until August, 5, 2026, this dataset is part of a collection of estimates produced for Financing Global Health (FGH) 2026 with a batch release date of November 14, 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description>
     <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 06:55:04 -0700</pubDate>
 <dc:creator>GHDx</dc:creator>
 <guid isPermaLink="false">630085 at https://ghdx.healthdata.org</guid>
 <comments />
  </item>
