  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Development Assistance for Health Database 1990-2026, 11 June 2026</title>
    <link>https://ghdx.healthdata.org/record/ihme-data/dah-1990-2026-20260611</link>
    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-time field-type-datetime field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;January, 1990 - December, 2026&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;	&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-type field-type-taxonomy-term-reference field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
				&lt;div class=&quot;field-items clearfix&quot;&gt;
							&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/data-type/estimate&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot; datatype=&quot;&quot;&gt;Estimate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
					&lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-provider field-type-taxonomy-term-reference field-label-inline clearfix&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;Provider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/organizations/institute-health-metrics-and-evaluation-ihme&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot; datatype=&quot;&quot;&gt;Institute for Health Metrics and Evaluation (IHME)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-summary field-type-text field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This version of the Development Assistance for Health (DAH) Database includes estimates for 1990-2026, which are based on project databases, financial statements, annual reports, IRS 990s, and correspondence with agencies. The DAH Database enables comprehensive analysis of trends in international disbursements of grants and loans for health projects in low- and middle-income countries from key agencies. The data are disaggregated by source of funds, channel of funding, country and geographic region, health focus areas, and program areas. The data for 2026 are preliminary. The data for 2025 are a mix of preliminary and final estimates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To better understand the data and how to use it, please refer to the IHME DAH Database 2026 User Guide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description>
     <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 06:58:41 -0700</pubDate>
 <dc:creator>GHDx</dc:creator>
